@startuml
title GenAI unit test generation — component diagram

actor "C# developer" as Developer
component "Rider integration\n(proposed)" as Rider

package "Thesis system" {
  component "Test generation pipeline" as Pipeline
  component "Code context extractor" as Context
  component "RAG retrieval" as Retrieval
  database "Reference code and test examples" as Examples
  component "GenAI model" as Model
  component ".NET test execution\nand coverage analysis" as Runner
}

Developer --> Rider : selects C# code
Rider --> Pipeline : submits code and displays results
Pipeline --> Context : prepares source context
Pipeline --> Retrieval : searches for relevant examples
Retrieval --> Examples : retrieves examples
Pipeline --> Model : generates or revises unit tests
Pipeline --> Runner : builds, runs, and measures coverage
@enduml